container"><div><div data-wf--header--variant="left-gap" class="carousel-header w-variant-6d41f94e-9094-7379-9671-09cb17a6be86"><h2 class="heading-2">Electric Intelligence Driving<span class="text-span"> Your Business</span> <br/></h2><p class="paragraph-2">Our electric pickup range combines a rugged, stylish build with advanced technology and industry-first features to deliver exceptional performance and reliability.<br/></p></div></div><div class="slider_component"><div class="slider_wrap swiper"><div class="slider_list swiper-wrapper"><div data-wf--slider_item--variant="base" class="slider_item swiper-slide"><div class="slot"><div class="card"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69ca85cf10ac735a5c84237d_e1bd2f074df8bde9688c10d02d18c65bedb9946f%20(1).png" loading="lazy" width="Auto" height="Auto" alt="" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 100vw, (max-width: 991px) 728px, 940px" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69ca85cf10ac735a5c84237d_e1bd2f074df8bde9688c10d02d18c65bedb9946f%20(1)-p-500.png 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69ca85cf10ac735a5c84237d_e1bd2f074df8bde9688c10d02d18c65bedb9946f%20(1).png 800w" class="image-32"/><div class="div-block-415"><h3 class="text-block-67">Over The Air Updates</h3><div class="text-block-68">Keep your vehicle updated without service visits. OTA updates ensure the system software stays current, reducing downtime and improving overall performance.<br/></div></div></div></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/plugins/Basic/assets/placeholder.60f9b1840c.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-181"/></div><div data-wf--slider_item--variant="base" class="slider_item swiper-slide"><div class="slot"><div class="card"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69ca85cf8536f72f8377c8f0_b87aa8b8a41c78a935474db56266ec978022f48a%20(1).jpg" loading="lazy" width="Auto" height="Auto" alt="" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 100