your everyday cargo needs, ensuring stable and secure load handling.<br/></p></div></div></div><img src="" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-312"/></div><div class="slider_item swiper-slide"><div class="slot-2"><div class="interior-card-large"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69c106af0e030cd21a21cf93_Montra%20EViator-21.jpg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-311"/><div class="interior-card-overlay"><div class="heading-card"><img width="20" height="20" alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b143ce3bf1a26cc50e0b8f_marketeq_chassis.png" class="image-310"/><h3 class="interior-card-title">Cab and Chassis</h3></div><p class="paragraph-170">Stronger frame. Safer rides.</p></div></div></div><img src="" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-312"/></div></div></div><div class="slider_btn_element_left swiper-button-disabled is-prev"><div class="left-chevron-white-4 w-icon-slider-left"></div></div><div class="slider_btn_element_right is-next"><div class="right-chevron-white-2 w-icon-slider-right"></div></div><div class="slider_layout"></div></div></div></section><div class="w-layout-blockcontainer base-container-padding-flex-gap-copy spacing w-container"><div class="div-block-389"><div data-wf--header--variant="left-gap" class="carousel-header w-variant-6d41f94e-9094-7379-9671-09cb17a6be86"><h2 class="heading-2">Electric Intelligence Driving<span class="text-span"> Your Business</span> <br/></h2><p class="paragraph-2">Our electric pickup range combines a rugged, stylish build with advanced technology and industry-first features to deliver exceptional performance and reliability.<br/></p></div></div><div class="slider_component"><div class="slider_wrap swiper"><div class="slider_list swiper-wrapper"><div data-wf--slider_item--variant="base" class="slider_item swiper-slide"><div class="slot"><div class="card"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69ca85cf10ac735a5