-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3873d5328639035411e75_bi_truck-flatbed.png" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" alt="" class="image-195"/><h3 class="interior-card-title">FSD (normal load deck)</h3></div><p class="paragraph-11">Made for your everyday cargo needs, ensuring stable and secure load handling.<br/></p></div></div></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/plugins/Basic/assets/placeholder.60f9b1840c.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-181"/></div><div data-wf--slider_item--variant="base" class="slider_item swiper-slide"><div class="slot"><div class="interior-card-large"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69c106af0e030cd21a21cf93_Montra%20EViator-21.jpg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-10"/><div class="interior-card-overlay"><div class="heading-card"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b143ce3bf1a26cc50e0b8f_marketeq_chassis.png" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" alt="" class="image-195"/><h3 class="interior-card-title">Cab and Chassis</h3></div><p class="paragraph-11">Stronger frame. Safer rides.</p></div></div></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/plugins/Basic/assets/placeholder.60f9b1840c.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-181"/></div></div></div><div class="slider_btn_element_left swiper-button-disabled is-prev"><div class="left-chevron-white w-icon-slider-left"></div></div><div class="slider_btn_element_right is-next"><div class="right-chevron-white w-icon-slider-right"></div></div><div class="slider_layout"></div></div></div></section><div class="w-layout-blockcontainer base-container-padding-flex-gap-copy spacing w-container"><div class="div-block-389"><div data-wf--header--variant="base" class="carousel-header"><h2 class="heading-2">Reefer Option</h2><p class="paragraph-2">Temperature-controlled cargo solution with:</p></div></div><div class="div-block-173"><div class="card"><img sizes="(max-width: 767px) 100vw, (max-width: 991px) 95vw, 940px" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3c2601f8499c0446ba559_REEFER%20BANNERS-01_11zon-p-500.webp 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3c2601f8499c0446ba559_REEFER%20BANNERS-01_11zon-p-800.webp 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3c2601f8499c0446ba559_REEFER%20BANNERS-01_11zon-p-1080.webp 1080w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3c2601f8499c0446ba559_REEFER%20BANNERS-01_11zon-p-1600.webp 1600w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3c2601f8499c0446ba559_REEFER%20BANNERS-01_11zon.webp 1917w" alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3c2601f8499c0446ba559_REEFER%20BANNERS-01_11zon.webp" class="image-32"/><div><div class="reefer-text"><strong>Wide temperature range:</strong> –25°C to +25°C</div></div></div><div class="card"><img sizes="(max-width: 767px) 100vw, (max-width: 991px) 95vw, 940px" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3c265236861260d74d791_REEFER%20BANNERS-02_11zon-p-500.webp 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3c265236861260d74d791_REEFER%20BANNERS-02_11zon-p-800.webp 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3c265236861260d74d791_REEFER%20BANNERS-02_11zon-p-1080.webp 1080w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3c265236861260d74d791_REEFER%20BANNERS-02_11zon-p-1600.webp 1600w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3c265236861260d74d791_REEFER%20BANNERS-02_11zon.webp 1917w" alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3c265236861260d74d791_REEFER%20BANNERS-02_11zon.webp" class="image-32"/><div><div class="reefer-text"><strong>Capacity:</strong> up to 344 cubic feet</div></div></div><div class="card"><img sizes="(max-width: 767px) 100vw, (max-width: 991px) 95vw, 940px" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69c3cc5ed6e1f660335fc71c_REEFER%20BANNERS-03_11zon-p-500.webp 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69c3cc5ed6e1f660335fc71c_REEFER%20BANNERS-03_11zon-p-800.webp 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69c3cc5ed6e1f660335fc71c_REEFER%20BANNERS-03_11zon-p-1080.webp 1080w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69c3cc5ed6e1f660335fc71c_REEFER%20BANNERS-03_11zon.webp 1917w" alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69c3cc5ed6e1f660335fc71c_REEFER%20BANNERS-03_11zon.webp"/><div><div class="reefer-text"><strong>270° rear gate with aluminium flooring </strong>for efficient loading.</div></div></div></div></div><section class="base-container-padding-flex-gap old"><div data-wf--header--variant="base" class="carousel-header"><h2 class="heading-2">Features</h2><p class="paragraph-2">Advanced electric technology, powerful performance, smart connectivity, and driver-focused comfort designed to make every journey efficient and reliable.<br/></p></div><div data-current="Tab 4" data-easing="ease" data-duration-in="300" data-duration-out="100" class="tabs-2 only-slider-2 w-tabs"><div class="tabs-menu-3 only-slider-3 w-tab-menu"><a data-w-tab="Tab 4" class="tab-link-tab-1-3 only-slider-13 w-inline-block w-tab-link w--current"><div>Performance</div></a><a data-w-tab="Tab 5" class="tab-link-tab-1-3 only-slider-13 w-inline-block w-tab-link"><div class="text-block-59 only-slider-6">Style</div></a><a data-w-tab="Tab 6" class="tab-link-tab-1-3 only-slider-13 w-inline-block w-tab-link"><div class="text-block-60 only-slider-8">Technology</div></a><a data-w-tab="Tab 7" class="tab-link-tab-1-3 only-slider-13 w-inline-block w-tab-link"><div class="text-block-61 only-slider-10">Safety</div></a><a data-w-tab="Tab 8" class="tab-link-tab-1-3 only-slider-13 w-inline-block w-tab-link"><div class="text-block-62 only-slider-14">Comfort</div></a><a data-w-tab="Tab 9" class="tab-link-tab-1-3 only-slider-13 w-inline-block w-tab-link"><div class="text-block-62 only-slider-14">Convenience</div></a></div><div class="tabs-content only-slider-15 w-tab-content"><div data-w-tab="Tab 4" class="tab-pane-tab-4-2 only-slider-16 w-tab-pane w--tab-active"><div class="slider_component"><div class="slider_wrap swiper"><div class="slider_list swiper-wrapper"><div data-wf--slider_item--variant="base" class="slider_item swiper-slide"><div class="slot"><div class="last-mile-card"><img width="480" height="100" alt="" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69df45161506a156e82254f7_69b3aedeef14b16145557249_9457bc60dba9264fd8461b4b40b5d3e99b83129b%20(1).png" loading="lazy" class="image-131"/><div class="card-content-2"><h3 class="heading-102">First in Segment Highest Range</h3><p class="paragraph-131">Industry-leading <strong>certified range of 292 km</strong> and a <strong>real-world range of around 170+ km</strong> on a single charge with full rated load, enabling longer trips with fewer charging interruptions.<br/></p></div></div></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/plugins/Basic/assets/placeholder.60f9b1840c.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-181"/></div><div data-wf--slider_item--variant="base" class="slider_item swiper-slide"><div class="slot"><div class="last-mile-card"><img width="480" height="100" alt="" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3fbacd3e0f7de0b7ce8bb_Montra%20EViator-11.jpg" loading="lazy" class="image-131"/><div class="card-content-2"><h3 class="heading-102">Highest Power &amp; Torque</h3><p class="paragraph-131">The vehicle delivers <strong>80 kW peak power and 300 Nm peak torque</strong>, ensuring strong acceleration and reliable performance even when carrying heavy loads.<br/></p></div></div></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/plugins/Basic/assets/placeholder.60f9b1840c.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-181"/></div><div data-wf--slider_item--variant="base" class="slider_item swiper-slide"><div class="slot"><div class="last-mile-card"><img width="480" height="100" alt="" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69df45381d5f37d1d37cd356_69b3aede5f06caa01a1c3cfd_ff92460656eaf867be1b1c255e5ae54101805a4c.png" loading="lazy" class="image-131"/><div class="card-content-2"><h3 class="heading-102">Best In Class Payload</h3><p class="paragraph-131">The EVIATOR features a <strong>10.3-ft loading deck and payload capacity of about 1.7 tons</strong>, making it suitable for various logistics and delivery applications.<br/></p></div></div></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/plugins/Basic/assets/placeholder.60f9b1840c.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-181"/></div><div data-wf--slider_item--variant="base" class="slider_item swiper-slide"><div class="slot"><div class="last-mile-card"><img width="480" height="100" alt="" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69df451741edcb3e5263ef03_69b3aede0c6d23e18408d661_35fb15fb18eeddc22839609b70be5ceaf9e3f803.png" loading="lazy" class="image-131"/><div class="card-content-2"><h3 class="heading-102">Maximum Gradeability</h3><p class="paragraph-131">Designed to handle challenging terrain with <strong>25% restart gradeability and 35% running gradeability</strong>, ensuring smooth operation on steep inclines.<br/></p></div></div></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/plugins/Basic/assets/placeholder.60f9b1840c.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-181"/></div><div data-wf--slider_item--variant="base" class="slider_item swiper-slide"><div class="slot"><div class="last-mile-card"><img width="480" height="100" alt="" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69df4516f52d9e1554cabb3d_69b3aedd042ee8149312aa02_9eef29df5a1ed59ba57d580498e8b91c70fbf077.png" loading="lazy" class="image-131"/><div class="card-content-2"><h3 class="heading-102">Best in class Top Speed</h3><p class="paragraph-131">Reach up to 80 km/h, enabling faster trips and more business opportunities.</p></div></div></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/plugins/Basic/assets/placeholder.60f9b1840c.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-181"/></div><div data-wf--slider_item--variant="base" class="slider_item swiper-slide"><div class="slot"><div class="last-mile-card"><img width="480" height="100" alt="" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69df4516603ff69c85197c27_69b3aedd5f06caa01a1c3cde_af147626d52f6281ffc2e26f036bc09f8c6faf52.png" loading="lazy" class="image-131"/><div class="card-content-2"><h3 class="heading-102">CCS2 Fast Charging</h3><p class="paragraph-131">Supports both AC and DC charging options.<br/>‍<strong>AC Charging:</strong> 0% – 80% in approximately 6 hours<br/><strong>DC Fast Charging:</strong> 0% – 80% in around 1 hour<br/></p></div></div></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/plugins/Basic/assets/placeholder.60f9b1840c.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-181"/></div></div></div><div class="slider_btn_element_left swiper-button-disabled is-prev"><div class="left-chevron-white w-icon-slider-left"></div></div><div class="slider_btn_element_right is-next"><div class="right-chevron-white w-icon-slider-right"></div></div><div class="slider_layout"></div></div></div><div data-w-tab="Tab 5" class="w-tab-pane"><div class="slider_component"><div class="slider_wrap swiper"><div class="slider_list swiper-wrapper"><div data-wf--slider_item--variant="base" class="slider_item swiper-slide"><div class="slot"><div class="last-mile-card"><div class="card-image-wrap"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3aedd236861260d72b6d5_9697eb44af70b91f8af6a9c32568a41880818951.png" loading="lazy" width="480" height="100" alt="" sizes="(max-width: 479px) 100vw, 480px" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3aedd236861260d72b6d5_9697eb44af70b91f8af6a9c32568a41880818951-p-500.png 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3aedd236861260d72b6d5_9697eb44af70b91f8af6a9c32568a41880818951-p-800.png 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3aedd236861260d72b6d5_9697eb44af70b91f8af6a9c32568a41880818951.png 920w" class="image-5"/></div><div class="card-content"><h3 class="heading">LED Headlamps with DRLs</h3><p class="paragraph">First-in-segment LED headlamps with DRLs improve visibility while enhancing the vehicle’s modern styling.<br/></p></div></div></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/plugins/Basic/assets/placeholder.60f9b1840c.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-181"/></div><div data-wf--slider_item--variant="base" class="slider_item swiper-slide"><div class="slot"><div class="last-mile-card"><div class="card-image-wrap"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3aede21fb0e7e2c9b5a71_39ec5e961469a1e9184b26e3f56b053499d843b1.png" loading="lazy" width="480" height="100" alt="" sizes="(max-width: 479px) 100vw, 480px" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3aede21fb0e7e2c9b5a71_39ec5e961469a1e9184b26e3f56b053499d843b1-p-500.png 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3aede21fb0e7e2c9b5a71_39ec5e961469a1e9184b26e3f56b053499d843b1-p-800.png 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3aede21fb0e7e2c9b5a71_39ec5e961469a1e9184b26e3f56b053499d843b1.png 920w" class="image-5"/></div><div class="card-content"><h3 class="heading">Premium Seats</h3><p class="paragraph">Comfortable <strong>D+2 seating configuration</strong> provides better support and space for the driver and passengers.<br/></p></div></div></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/plugins/Basic/assets/placeholder.60f9b1840c.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-181"/></div><div data-wf--slider_item--variant="base" class="slider_item swiper-slide"><div class="slot"><div class="last-mile-card"><div class="card-image-wrap"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3aedd628398b30bbc4cdd_5b8b15b5d48a69bcc94e7d80385b13d1a3a3f4aa.png" loading="lazy" width="480" height="100" alt="" sizes="(max-width: 479px) 100vw, 480px" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3aedd628398b30bbc4cdd_5b8b15b5d48a69bcc94e7d80385b13d1a3a3f4aa-p-500.png 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3aedd628398b30bbc4cdd_5b8b15b5d48a69bcc94e7d80385b13d1a3a3f4aa-p-800.png 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3aedd628398b30bbc4cdd_5b8b15b5d48a69bcc94e7d80385b13d1a3a3f4aa.png 920w" class="image-5"/></div><div class="card-content"><h3 class="heading">Premium Metallic Colours</h3><p class="paragraph">Designed with premium color options to deliver a bold and professional road presence.<br/></p></div></div></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/plugins/Basic/assets/placeholder.60f9b1840c.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-181"/></div><div data-wf--slider_item--variant="base" class="slider_item swiper-slide"><div class="slot"><div class="last-mile-card"><div class="card-image-wrap"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3aede584f882b4f6396aa_509b14a78a5769202835c22e43dd71dde5490504.png" loading="lazy" width="480" height="100" alt="" sizes="(max-width: 479px) 100vw, 480px" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3aede584f882b4f6396aa_509b14a78a5769202835c22e43dd71dde5490504-p-500.png 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3aede584f882b4f6396aa_509b14a78a5769202835c22e43dd71dde5490504-p-800.png 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3aede584f882b4f6396aa_509b14a78a5769202835c22e43dd71dde5490504.png 920w" class="image-5"/></div><div class="card-content"><h3 class="heading">Digital Cluster</h3><p class="paragraph">Provides real-time updates on speed, battery level, and driving range, giving drivers clear information at a glance.</p></div></div></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/plugins/Basic/assets/placeholder.60f9b1840c.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-181"/></div><div data-wf--slider_item--variant="base" class="slider_item swiper-slide"><div class="slot"><div class="last-mile-card"><div class="card-image-wrap"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3aede24ca1004f7e4743e_7a4a30a4245a8821fb1427ee00a9e7d28f25f80e.png" loading="lazy" width="480" height="100" alt="" sizes="(max-width: 479px) 100vw, 480px" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3aede24ca1004f7e4743e_7a4a30a4245a8821fb1427ee00a9e7d28f25f80e-p-500.png 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3aede24ca1004f7e4743e_7a4a30a4245a8821fb1427ee00a9e7d28f25f80e-p-800.png 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3aede24ca1004f7e4743e_7a4a30a4245a8821fb1427ee00a9e7d28f25f80e.png 920w" class="image-5"/></div><div class="card-content"><h3 class="heading">Eagle-Inspired Front Grill</h3><p class="paragraph">‍</p></div></div></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/plugins/Basic/assets/placeholder.60f9b1840c.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-181"/></div><div data-wf--slider_item--variant="base" class="slider_item swiper-slide"><div class="slot"><div class="last-mile-card"><div class="card-image-wrap"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3aeded498c5ec90f0b3ef_93c4249cbe0a499810ab5d0f8cb1f3023a375ade.png" loading="lazy" width="480" height="100" alt="" sizes="(max-width: 479px) 100vw, 480px" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3aeded498c5ec90f0b3ef_93c4249cbe0a499810ab5d0f8cb1f3023a375ade-p-500.png 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3aeded498c5ec90f0b3ef_93c4249cbe0a499810ab5d0f8cb1f3023a375ade-p-800.png 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3aeded498c5ec90f0b3ef_93c4249cbe0a499810ab5d0f8cb1f3023a375ade.png 920w" class="image-5"/></div><div class="card-content"><h3 class="heading">LED Tail Lights</h3><p class="paragraph">‍</p></div></div></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/plugins/Basic/assets/placeholder.60f9b1840c.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-181"/></div><div data-wf--slider_item--variant="base" class="slider_item swiper-slide"><div class="slot"><div class="last-mile-card"><div class="card-image-wrap"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3aeddf3d6889b41b8ef2f_935bcd6562197d425f7cf4b4bdcee68a093aaa88.png" loading="lazy" width="480" height="100" alt="" sizes="(max-width: 479px) 100vw, 480px" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3aeddf3d6889b41b8ef2f_935bcd6562197d425f7cf4b4bdcee68a093aaa88-p-500.png 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3aeddf3d6889b41b8ef2f_935bcd6562197d425f7cf4b4bdcee68a093aaa88-p-800.png 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3aeddf3d6889b41b8ef2f_935bcd6562197d425f7cf4b4bdcee68a093aaa88.png 920w" class="image-5"/></div><div class="card-content"><h3 class="heading">Wide-View Windshield</h3><p class="paragraph">AC Charging 0% - 80% ~ 6 Hrs DC charging 0-80% ~ 1 Hrs.</p></div></div></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/plugins/Basic/assets/placeholder.60f9b1840c.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-181"/></div></div></div><div class="slider_btn_element_left swiper-button-disabled is-prev"><div class="left-chevron-white w-icon-slider-left"></div></div><div class="slider_btn_element_right is-next"><div class="right-chevron-white w-icon-slider-right"></div></div><div class="slider_layout"></div></div></div><div data-w-tab="Tab 6" class="w-tab-pane"><div class="slider_component"><div class="slider_wrap swiper"><div class="slider_list swiper-wrapper"><div data-wf--slider_item--variant="base" class="slider_item swiper-slide"><div class="slot"><div class="last-mile-card"><div class="card-image-wrap"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3b4fc7506574e75e64408_lfpbattery.webp" loading="lazy" width="480" height="100" alt="" class="image-5"/></div><div class="card-content"><h3 class="heading">Advanced LFP Battery</h3><p class="paragraph">A liquid-cooled LFP battery improves safety, battery life, and consistent performance across different operating conditions.<br/></p></div></div></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/plugins/Basic/assets/placeholder.60f9b1840c.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-181"/></div><div data-wf--slider_item--variant="base" class="slider_item swiper-slide"><div class="slot"><div class="last-mile-card"><div class="card-image-wrap"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3b4fcf3d6889b41b98218_braking.webp" loading="lazy" width="480" height="100" alt="" class="image-5"/></div><div class="card-content"><h3 class="heading">Regenerative Braking</h3><p class="paragraph">Captures energy during deceleration and feeds it back to the battery, improving overall driving efficiency.<br/></p></div></div></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/plugins/Basic/assets/placeholder.60f9b1840c.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-181"/></div><div data-wf--slider_item--variant="base" class="slider_item swiper-slide"><div class="slot"><div class="last-mile-card"><div class="card-image-wrap"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3b4fb0c6d23e1840951e6_tech-Infotainment.webp" loading="lazy" width="480" height="100" alt="" class="image-5"/></div><div class="card-content"><h3 class="heading">Infotainment System</h3><p class="paragraph">Includes connected features such as navigation, reverse parking assistance, ADAS integration, and connected technologies.<br/></p></div></div></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/plugins/Basic/assets/placeholder.60f9b1840c.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-181"/></div><div data-wf--slider_item--variant="base" class="slider_item swiper-slide"><div class="slot"><div class="last-mile-card"><div class="card-image-wrap"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3b67e3ca8b37c1af89613_scv_tech_sdv.webp" loading="lazy" width="480" height="100" alt="" class="image-5"/></div><div class="card-content"><h3 class="heading">Software Defined Vehicle (SDV)</h3><p class="paragraph">Advanced digital architecture with features like:<br/>Over-the-air updates (OTA)<br/>Digital twin technology<br/>1M connected app for diagnostics and performance tracking.<br/></p></div></div></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/plugins/Basic/assets/placeholder.60f9b1840c.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-181"/></div></div></div><div class="slider_btn_element_left swiper-button-disabled is-prev"><div class="left-chevron-white w-icon-slider-left"></div></div><div class="slider_btn_element_right is-next"><div class="right-chevron-white w-icon-slider-right"></div></div><div class="slider_layout"></div></div></div><div data-w-tab="Tab 7" class="w-tab-pane"><div class="slider_component"><div class="slider_wrap swiper"><div class="slider_list swiper-wrapper"><div data-wf--slider_item--variant="base" class="slider_item swiper-slide"><div class="slot"><div class="last-mile-card"><div class="card-image-wrap"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3b4fb7506574e75e643f0_scv_safety_adas.webp" loading="lazy" width="480" height="100" alt="" sizes="(max-width: 479px) 100vw, 480px" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3b4fb7506574e75e643f0_scv_safety_adas-p-500.webp 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3b4fb7506574e75e643f0_scv_safety_adas-p-800.webp 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3b4fb7506574e75e643f0_scv_safety_adas.webp 920w" class="image-5"/></div><div class="card-content"><h3 class="heading">ADAS</h3><p class="paragraph">Advanced Driver Assistance Systems provide features like collision warnings, driver monitoring, and distraction alerts to enhance road safety.<br/></p></div></div></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/plugins/Basic/assets/placeholder.60f9b1840c.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-181"/></div><div data-wf--slider_item--variant="base" class="slider_item swiper-slide"><div class="slot"><div class="last-mile-card"><div class="card-image-wrap"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3b4fb3e26f0f69bc18d4d_safety-robustchassis.webp" loading="lazy" width="480" height="100" alt="" sizes="(max-width: 479px) 100vw, 480px" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3b4fb3e26f0f69bc18d4d_safety-robustchassis-p-500.webp 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3b4fb3e26f0f69bc18d4d_safety-robustchassis.webp 920w" class="image-5"/></div><div class="card-content"><h3 class="heading">Robust And Durable Chassis</h3><p class="paragraph">Strong chassis design improves structural strength, stability, and reliability.<br/></p></div></div></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/plugins/Basic/assets/placeholder.60f9b1840c.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-181"/></div><div data-wf--slider_item--variant="base" class="slider_item swiper-slide"><div class="slot"><div class="last-mile-card"><div class="card-image-wrap"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3b4fbbd3583189f19fa89_frontdisk.webp" loading="lazy" width="480" height="100" alt="" sizes="(max-width: 479px) 100vw, 480px" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3b4fbbd3583189f19fa89_frontdisk-p-500.webp 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3b4fbbd3583189f19fa89_frontdisk.webp 920w" class="image-5"/></div><div class="card-content"><h3 class="heading">Front Disc Brake</h3><p class="paragraph">Front disc brakes provide better stopping power and improved safety.<br/></p></div></div></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/plugins/Basic/assets/placeholder.60f9b1840c.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-181"/></div><div data-wf--slider_item--variant="base" class="slider_item swiper-slide"><div class="slot"><div class="last-mile-card"><div class="card-image-wrap"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3b4fb407e77f3006965ae_loadbalance.webp" loading="lazy" width="480" height="100" alt="" sizes="(max-width: 479px) 100vw, 480px" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3b4fb407e77f3006965ae_loadbalance-p-500.webp 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3b4fb407e77f3006965ae_loadbalance.webp 920w" class="image-5"/></div><div class="card-content"><h3 class="heading">Load Balance Rod</h3><p class="paragraph">Helps distribute weight evenly for improved vehicle balance and handling.<br/></p></div></div></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/plugins/Basic/assets/placeholder.60f9b1840c.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-181"/></div><div data-wf--slider_item--variant="base" class="slider_item swiper-slide"><div class="slot"><div class="last-mile-card"><div class="card-image-wrap"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3b4fb3ca8b37c1af86466_protectedpower.webp" loading="lazy" width="480" height="100" alt="" sizes="(max-width: 479px) 100vw, 480px" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3b4fb3ca8b37c1af86466_protectedpower-p-500.webp 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3b4fb3ca8b37c1af86466_protectedpower.webp 920w" class="image-5"/></div><div class="card-content"><h3 class="heading">IP67 Protected Power Electronics</h3><p class="paragraph">Ensures reliability and durability even in harsh weather or operating environments.<br/></p></div></div></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/plugins/Basic/assets/placeholder.60f9b1840c.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-181"/></div><div data-wf--slider_item--variant="base" class="slider_item swiper-slide"><div class="slot"><div class="last-mile-card"><div class="card-image-wrap"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3b4fb9049c18e8725cb49_hillholdassist.webp" loading="lazy" width="480" height="100" alt="" sizes="(max-width: 479px) 100vw, 480px" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3b4fb9049c18e8725cb49_hillholdassist-p-500.webp 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3b4fb9049c18e8725cb49_hillholdassist-p-800.webp 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3b4fb9049c18e8725cb49_hillholdassist.webp 920w" class="image-5"/></div><div class="card-content"><h3 class="heading">Hill-hold Assist</h3><p class="paragraph">Prevents rollback when starting on slopes, improving safety and driver confidence.<br/></p></div></div></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/plugins/Basic/assets/placeholder.60f9b1840c.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-181"/></div><div data-wf--slider_item--variant="base" class="slider_item swiper-slide"><div class="slot"><div class="last-mile-card"><div class="card-image-wrap"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3b4fc7506574e75e64408_lfpbattery.webp" loading="lazy" width="480" height="100" alt="" class="image-5"/></div><div class="card-content"><h3 class="heading">AIS-038 Phase 2 Compliance</h3><p class="paragraph">Complies with advanced vehicle safety standards.<br/></p></div></div></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/plugins/Basic/assets/placeholder.60f9b1840c.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-181"/></div><div data-wf--slider_item--variant="base" class="slider_item swiper-slide"><div class="slot"><div class="last-mile-card"><div class="card-image-wrap"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3b4fb4833131f0dbb88da_fronteaxle.webp" loading="lazy" width="480" height="100" alt="" sizes="(max-width: 479px) 100vw, 480px" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3b4fb4833131f0dbb88da_fronteaxle-p-500.webp 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3b4fb4833131f0dbb88da_fronteaxle.webp 920w" class="image-5"/></div><div class="card-content"><h3 class="heading">Front Axle With I-Beam</h3><p class="paragraph">‍</p></div></div></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/plugins/Basic/assets/placeholder.60f9b1840c.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-181"/></div><div data-wf--slider_item--variant="base" class="slider_item swiper-slide"><div class="slot"><div class="last-mile-card"><div class="card-image-wrap"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3b4fb3380bc9365816a7f_reareaxle.webp" loading="lazy" width="480" height="100" alt="" sizes="(max-width: 479px) 100vw, 480px" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3b4fb3380bc9365816a7f_reareaxle-p-500.webp 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3b4fb3380bc9365816a7f_reareaxle.webp 920w" class="image-5"/></div><div class="card-content"><h3 class="heading">Rear E-axle With Motor (Industry Best)</h3><p class="paragraph"></p></div></div></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/plugins/Basic/assets/placeholder.60f9b1840c.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-181"/></div></div></div><div class="slider_btn_element_left swiper-button-disabled is-prev"><div class="left-chevron-white w-icon-slider-left"></div></div><div class="slider_btn_element_right is-next"><div class="right-chevron-white w-icon-slider-right"></div></div><div class="slider_layout"></div></div></div><div data-w-tab="Tab 8" class="w-tab-pane"><div class="slider_component"><div class="slider_wrap swiper"><div class="slider_list swiper-wrapper"><div data-wf--slider_item--variant="base" class="slider_item swiper-slide"><div class="slot"><div class="last-mile-card"><div class="card-image-wrap"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69df464881cf6f47f5b74f3b_accabin%20(1).png" loading="lazy" width="480" height="100" alt="" class="image-5"/></div><div class="card-content"><h3 class="heading">AC Cabin</h3><p class="paragraph">An air-conditioned cabin improves comfort during long working hours and increases productivity.<br/></p></div></div></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/plugins/Basic/assets/placeholder.60f9b1840c.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-181"/></div><div data-wf--slider_item--variant="base" class="slider_item swiper-slide"><div class="slot"><div class="last-mile-card"><div class="card-image-wrap"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3aedee2206536c558598e_feb512ec7d8c39bf124b75e37ee88106d46efa29.jpg" loading="lazy" width="480" height="100" alt="" sizes="(max-width: 479px) 100vw, 480px" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3aedee2206536c558598e_feb512ec7d8c39bf124b75e37ee88106d46efa29-p-500.jpg 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3aedee2206536c558598e_feb512ec7d8c39bf124b75e37ee88106d46efa29-p-800.jpg 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3aedee2206536c558598e_feb512ec7d8c39bf124b75e37ee88106d46efa29-p-1080.jpg 1080w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3aedee2206536c558598e_feb512ec7d8c39bf124b75e37ee88106d46efa29-p-1600.jpg 1600w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3aedee2206536c558598e_feb512ec7d8c39bf124b75e37ee88106d46efa29.jpg 1632w" class="image-5"/></div><div class="card-content"><h3 class="heading">Advanced 2-Stage Parabolic Suspension</h3><p class="paragraph">Designed for smoother rides and better load stability.<br/></p></div></div></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/plugins/Basic/assets/placeholder.60f9b1840c.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-181"/></div><div data-wf--slider_item--variant="base" class="slider_item swiper-slide"><div class="slot"><div class="last-mile-card"><div class="card-image-wrap"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3aede5f06caa01a1c3cfd_ff92460656eaf867be1b1c255e5ae54101805a4c.png" loading="lazy" width="480" height="100" alt="" class="image-5"/></div><div class="card-content"><h3 class="heading">Reclining Adjustable Driver Seat</h3><p class="paragraph">Driver seat with headrest and reclining adjustment for better ergonomics and reduced fatigue.<br/></p></div></div></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/plugins/Basic/assets/placeholder.60f9b1840c.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-181"/></div><div data-wf--slider_item--variant="base" class="slider_item swiper-slide"><div class="slot"><div class="last-mile-card"><div class="card-image-wrap"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69da2a3e67dfb880dfa4fb5f_comfort-drivemodes.webp" loading="lazy" width="480" height="100" alt="" sizes="(max-width: 479px) 100vw, 480px" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69da2a3e67dfb880dfa4fb5f_comfort-drivemodes-p-500.webp 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69da2a3e67dfb880dfa4fb5f_comfort-drivemodes-p-800.webp 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69da2a3e67dfb880dfa4fb5f_comfort-drivemodes.webp 920w" class="image-5"/></div><div class="card-content"><h3 class="heading">Smart Drive Mode Switch</h3><p class="paragraph">Drivers can switch between City mode and Power mode to match driving conditions.<br/></p></div></div></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/plugins/Basic/assets/placeholder.60f9b1840c.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-181"/></div><div data-wf--slider_item--variant="base" class="slider_item swiper-slide"><div class="slot"><div class="last-mile-card"><div class="card-image-wrap"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69da2a3e07e169d0e84ba385_groundclearance.webp" loading="lazy" width="480" height="100" alt="" sizes="(max-width: 479px) 100vw, 480px" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69da2a3e07e169d0e84ba385_groundclearance-p-500.webp 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69da2a3e07e169d0e84ba385_groundclearance.webp 920w" class="image-5"/></div><div class="card-content"><h3 class="heading">Best-in-Class Ground Clearance</h3><p class="paragraph">Around 197 mm ground clearance, allowing the vehicle to handle rough or uneven roads easily.<br/></p></div></div></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/plugins/Basic/assets/placeholder.60f9b1840c.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-181"/></div></div></div><div class="slider_btn_element_left swiper-button-disabled is-prev"><div class="left-chevron-white w-icon-slider-left"></div></div><div class="slider_btn_element_right is-next"><div class="right-chevron-white w-icon-slider-right"></div></div><div class="slider_layout"></div></div></div><div data-w-tab="Tab 9" class="w-tab-pane"><div class="slider_component"><div class="slider_wrap swiper"><div class="slider_list swiper-wrapper"><div data-wf--slider_item--variant="base" class="slider_item swiper-slide"><div class="slot"><div class="last-mile-card"><div class="card-image-wrap"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69da2ac556f34557d9171dda_walkthroughcabin.webp" loading="lazy" width="480" height="100" alt="" sizes="(max-width: 479px) 100vw, 480px" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69da2ac556f34557d9171dda_walkthroughcabin-p-500.webp 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69da2ac556f34557d9171dda_walkthroughcabin.webp 920w" class="image-5"/></div><div class="card-content"><h3 class="heading">Spacious Walkthrough Cabin</h3><p class="paragraph">Ergonomic cabin layout improves movement and comfort for the driver.</p></div></div></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/plugins/Basic/assets/placeholder.60f9b1840c.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-181"/></div><div data-wf--slider_item--variant="base" class="slider_item swiper-slide"><div class="slot"><div class="last-mile-card"><div class="card-image-wrap"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69da2ac567dfb880dfa5023a_steering.webp" loading="lazy" width="480" height="100" alt="" sizes="(max-width: 479px) 100vw, 480px" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69da2ac567dfb880dfa5023a_steering-p-500.webp 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69da2ac567dfb880dfa5023a_steering.webp 920w" class="image-5"/></div><div class="card-content"><h3 class="heading">Electric Power Steering</h3><p class="paragraph">Electric power steering ensures smoother control and reduces driver effort during long drives.<br/></p></div></div></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/plugins/Basic/assets/placeholder.60f9b1840c.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-181"/></div><div data-wf--slider_item--variant="base" class="slider_item swiper-slide"><div class="slot"><div class="last-mile-card"><div class="card-image-wrap"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69da2ac55931b223dc4fd9e8_chargingports.webp" loading="lazy" width="480" height="100" alt="" sizes="(max-width: 479px) 100vw, 480px" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69da2ac55931b223dc4fd9e8_chargingports-p-500.webp 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69da2ac55931b223dc4fd9e8_chargingports-p-800.webp 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69da2ac55931b223dc4fd9e8_chargingports.webp 920w" class="image-5"/></div><div class="card-content"><h3 class="heading">USB Charging Ports </h3><p class="paragraph">Conveniently placed USB ports keep your devices powered, wherever the day takes you.</p></div></div></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/plugins/Basic/assets/placeholder.60f9b1840c.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-181"/></div><div data-wf--slider_item--variant="base" class="slider_item swiper-slide"><div class="slot"><div class="last-mile-card"><div class="card-image-wrap"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69da2ac506cf5349b59dfc52_parkingcamera.webp" loading="lazy" width="480" height="100" alt="" sizes="(max-width: 479px) 100vw, 480px" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69da2ac506cf5349b59dfc52_parkingcamera-p-500.webp 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69da2ac506cf5349b59dfc52_parkingcamera.webp 920w" class="image-5"/></div><div class="card-content"><h3 class="heading">Reverse Parking Camera</h3><p class="paragraph">A clear rear view helps you park with confidence and avoid obstacles with ease.</p></div></div></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/plugins/Basic/assets/placeholder.60f9b1840c.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-181"/></div><div data-wf--slider_item--variant="base" class="slider_item swiper-slide"><div class="slot"><div class="last-mile-card"><div class="card-image-wrap"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69da2ac56193f610ba14bbd3_foglamps.webp" loading="lazy" width="480" height="100" alt="" sizes="(max-width: 479px) 100vw, 480px" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69da2ac56193f610ba14bbd3_foglamps-p-500.webp 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69da2ac56193f610ba14bbd3_foglamps-p-800.webp 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69da2ac56193f610ba14bbd3_foglamps.webp 920w" class="image-5"/></div><div class="card-content"><h3 class="heading">Fog Lamps</h3><p class="paragraph">Powerful fog lamps enhance visibility, keeping you safe in low-light and foggy conditions.</p></div></div></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/plugins/Basic/assets/placeholder.60f9b1840c.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-181"/></div></div></div><div class="slider_btn_element_left swiper-button-disabled is-prev"><div class="left-chevron-white w-icon-slider-left"></div></div><div class="slider_btn_element_right is-next"><div class="right-chevron-white w-icon-slider-right"></div></div><div class="slider_layout"></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="base-container-padding-flex-gap-copy spacing"><div class="div-block-389"><div data-wf--header--variant="base" class="carousel-header"><h2 class="heading-2">Features</h2><p class="paragraph-2">Advanced electric technology, powerful performance, smart connectivity, and driver-focused comfort designed to make every journey efficient and reliable.<br/></p></div></div><div data-current="Tab 4" data-easing="ease" data-duration-in="300" data-duration-out="100" class="tabs-2 only-slider-2 w-tabs"><div class="tabs-menu-3 only-slider-3 w-tab-menu"><a data-w-tab="Tab 4" class="tab-link-tab-1-3 only-slider-13 w-inline-block w-tab-link w--current"><div>Performance</div></a><a data-w-tab="Tab 5" class="tab-link-tab-1-3 only-slider-13 w-inline-block w-tab-link"><div class="text-block-59 only-slider-6">Style</div></a><a data-w-tab="Tab 6" class="tab-link-tab-1-3 only-slider-13 w-inline-block w-tab-link"><div class="text-block-60 only-slider-8">Technology</div></a><a data-w-tab="Tab 7" class="tab-link-tab-1-3 only-slider-13 w-inline-block w-tab-link"><div class="text-block-61 only-slider-10">Safety</div></a><a data-w-tab="Tab 8" class="tab-link-tab-1-3 only-slider-13 w-inline-block w-tab-link"><div class="text-block-62 only-slider-14">Comfort</div></a><a data-w-tab="Tab 9" class="tab-link-tab-1-3 only-slider-13 w-inline-block w-tab-link"><div class="text-block-62 only-slider-14">Convenience</div></a></div><div class="tabs-content only-slider-15 w-tab-content"><div data-w-tab="Tab 4" class="tab-pane-tab-4-2 only-slider-16 w-tab-pane w--tab-active"><div class="slider_component"><div class="slider_wrap swiper"><div class="slider_list swiper-wrapper"><div data-wf--slider_item--variant="base" class="slider_item swiper-slide"><div class="slot"><div class="last-mile-card"><img width="480" height="100" alt="" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69df45161506a156e82254f7_69b3aedeef14b16145557249_9457bc60dba9264fd8461b4b40b5d3e99b83129b%20(1).png" loading="lazy" class="image-131"/><div class="card-content-2"><h3 class="heading-102">First in Segment Highest Range</h3><p class="paragraph-131">Industry-leading <strong>certified range of 292 km</strong> and a <strong>real-world range of around 170+ km</strong> on a single charge with full rated load, enabling longer trips with fewer charging interruptions.<br/></p></div></div></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/plugins/Basic/assets/placeholder.60f9b1840c.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-181"/></div><div data-wf--slider_item--variant="base" class="slider_item swiper-slide"><div class="slot"><div class="last-mile-card"><img width="480" height="100" alt="" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3fbacd3e0f7de0b7ce8bb_Montra%20EViator-11.jpg" loading="lazy" class="image-131"/><div class="card-content-2"><h3 class="heading-102">Highest Power &amp; Torque</h3><p class="paragraph-131">The vehicle delivers <strong>80 kW peak power and 300 Nm peak torque</strong>, ensuring strong acceleration and reliable performance even when carrying heavy loads.<br/></p></div></div></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/plugins/Basic/assets/placeholder.60f9b1840c.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-181"/></div><div data-wf--slider_item--variant="base" class="slider_item swiper-slide"><div class="slot"><div class="last-mile-card"><img width="480" height="100" alt="" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69df45381d5f37d1d37cd356_69b3aede5f06caa01a1c3cfd_ff92460656eaf867be1b1c255e5ae54101805a4c.png" loading="lazy" class="image-131"/><div class="card-content-2"><h3 class="heading-102">Best In Class Payload</h3><p class="paragraph-131">The EVIATOR features a <strong>10.3-ft loading deck and payload capacity of about 1.7 tons</strong>, making it suitable for various logistics and delivery applications.<br/></p></div></div></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/plugins/Basic/assets/placeholder.60f9b1840c.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-181"/></div><div data-wf--slider_item--variant="base" class="slider_item swiper-slide"><div class="slot"><div class="last-mile-card"><img width="480" height="100" alt="" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69df451741edcb3e5263ef03_69b3aede0c6d23e18408d661_35fb15fb18eeddc22839609b70be5ceaf9e3f803.png" loading="lazy" class="image-131"/><div class="card-content-2"><h3 class="heading-102">Maximum Gradeability</h3><p class="paragraph-131">Designed to handle challenging terrain with <strong>25% restart gradeability and 35% running gradeability</strong>, ensuring smooth operation on steep inclines.<br/></p></div></div></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/plugins/Basic/assets/placeholder.60f9b1840c.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-181"/></div><div data-wf--slider_item--variant="base" class="slider_item swiper-slide"><div class="slot"><div class="last-mile-card"><img width="480" height="100" alt="" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69df4516f52d9e1554cabb3d_69b3aedd042ee8149312aa02_9eef29df5a1ed59ba57d580498e8b91c70fbf077.png" loading="lazy" class="image-131"/><div class="card-content-2"><h3 class="heading-102">Best in class Top Speed</h3><p class="paragraph-131">Reach up to 80 km/h, enabling faster trips and more business opportunities.</p></div></div></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/plugins/Basic/assets/placeholder.60f9b1840c.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-181"/></div><div data-wf--slider_item--variant="base" class="slider_item swiper-slide"><div class="slot"><div class="last-mile-card"><img width="480" height="100" alt="" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69df4516603ff69c85197c27_69b3aedd5f06caa01a1c3cde_af147626d52f6281ffc2e26f036bc09f8c6faf52.png" loading="lazy" class="image-131"/><div class="card-content-2"><h3 class="heading-102">CCS2 Fast Charging</h3><p class="paragraph-131">Supports both AC and DC charging options.<br/>‍<strong>AC Charging:</strong> 0% – 80% in approximately 6 hours<br/><strong>DC Fast Charging:</strong> 0% – 80% in around 1 hour<br/></p></div></div></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/plugins/Basic/assets/placeholder.60f9b1840c.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-181"/></div></div></div><div class="slider_btn_element_left swiper-button-disabled is-prev"><div class="left-chevron-white w-icon-slider-left"></div></div><div class="slider_btn_element_right is-next"><div class="right-chevron-white w-icon-slider-right"></div></div><div class="slider_layout"></div></div></div><div data-w-tab="Tab 5" class="w-tab-pane"><div class="slider_component"><div class="slider_wrap swiper"><div class="slider_list swiper-wrapper"><div data-wf--slider_item--variant="base" class="slider_item swiper-slide"><div class="slot"><div class="last-mile-card"><div class="card-image-wrap"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3aedd236861260d72b6d5_9697eb44af70b91f8af6a9c32568a41880818951.png" loading="lazy" width="480" height="100" alt="" sizes="(max-width: 479px) 100vw, 480px" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3aedd236861260d72b6d5_9697eb44af70b91f8af6a9c32568a41880818951-p-500.png 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3aedd236861260d72b6d5_9697eb44af70b91f8af6a9c32568a41880818951-p-800.png 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3aedd236861260d72b6d5_9697eb44af70b91f8af6a9c32568a41880818951.png 920w" class="image-5"/></div><div class="card-content"><h3 class="heading">LED Headlamps with DRLs</h3><p class="paragraph">First-in-segment LED headlamps with DRLs improve visibility while enhancing the vehicle’s modern styling.<br/></p></div></div></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/plugins/Basic/assets/placeholder.60f9b1840c.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-181"/></div><div data-wf--slider_item--variant="base" class="slider_item swiper-slide"><div class="slot"><div class="last-mile-card"><div class="card-image-wrap"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3aede21fb0e7e2c9b5a71_39ec5e961469a1e9184b26e3f56b053499d843b1.png" loading="lazy" width="480" height="100" alt="" sizes="(max-width: 479px) 100vw, 480px" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3aede21fb0e7e2c9b5a71_39ec5e961469a1e9184b26e3f56b053499d843b1-p-500.png 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3aede21fb0e7e2c9b5a71_39ec5e961469a1e9184b26e3f56b053499d843b1-p-800.png 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3aede21fb0e7e2c9b5a71_39ec5e961469a1e9184b26e3f56b053499d843b1.png 920w" class="image-5"/></div><div class="card-content"><h3 class="heading">Premium Seats</h3><p class="paragraph">Comfortable <strong>D+2 seating configuration</strong> provides better support and space for the driver and passengers.<br/></p></div></div></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/plugins/Basic/assets/placeholder.60f9b1840c.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-181"/></div><div data-wf--slider_item--variant="base" class="slider_item swiper-slide"><div class="slot"><div class="last-mile-card"><div class="card-image-wrap"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3aedd628398b30bbc4cdd_5b8b15b5d48a69bcc94e7d80385b13d1a3a3f4aa.png" loading="lazy" width="480" height="100" alt="" sizes="(max-width: 479px) 100vw, 480px" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3aedd628398b30bbc4cdd_5b8b15b5d48a69bcc94e7d80385b13d1a3a3f4aa-p-500.png 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3aedd628398b30bbc4cdd_5b8b15b5d48a69bcc94e7d80385b13d1a3a3f4aa-p-800.png 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3aedd628398b30bbc4cdd_5b8b15b5d48a69bcc94e7d80385b13d1a3a3f4aa.png 920w" class="image-5"/></div><div class="card-content"><h3 class="heading">Premium Metallic Colours</h3><p class="paragraph">Designed with premium color options to deliver a bold and professional road presence.<br/></p></div></div></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/plugins/Basic/assets/placeholder.60f9b1840c.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-181"/></div><div data-wf--slider_item--variant="base" class="slider_item swiper-slide"><div class="slot"><div class="last-mile-card"><div class="card-image-wrap"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3aede584f882b4f6396aa_509b14a78a5769202835c22e43dd71dde5490504.png" loading="lazy" width="480" height="100" alt="" sizes="(max-width: 479px) 100vw, 480px" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3aede584f882b4f6396aa_509b14a78a5769202835c22e43dd71dde5490504-p-500.png 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3aede584f882b4f6396aa_509b14a78a5769202835c22e43dd71dde5490504-p-800.png 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3aede584f882b4f6396aa_509b14a78a5769202835c22e43dd71dde5490504.png 920w" class="image-5"/></div><div class="card-content"><h3 class="heading">Digital Cluster</h3><p class="paragraph">Provides real-time updates on speed, battery level, and driving range, giving drivers clear information at a glance.</p></div></div></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/plugins/Basic/assets/placeholder.60f9b1840c.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-181"/></div><div data-wf--slider_item--variant="base" class="slider_item swiper-slide"><div class="slot"><div class="last-mile-card"><div class="card-image-wrap"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3aede24ca1004f7e4743e_7a4a30a4245a8821fb1427ee00a9e7d28f25f80e.png" loading="lazy" width="480" height="100" alt="" sizes="(max-width: 479px) 100vw, 480px" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3aede24ca1004f7e4743e_7a4a30a4245a8821fb1427ee00a9e7d28f25f80e-p-500.png 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3aede24ca1004f7e4743e_7a4a30a4245a8821fb1427ee00a9e7d28f25f80e-p-800.png 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3aede24ca1004f7e4743e_7a4a30a4245a8821fb1427ee00a9e7d28f25f80e.png 920w" class="image-5"/></div><div class="card-content"><h3 class="heading">Eagle-Inspired Front Grill</h3><p class="paragraph">‍</p></div></div></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/plugins/Basic/assets/placeholder.60f9b1840c.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-181"/></div><div data-wf--slider_item--variant="base" class="slider_item swiper-slide"><div class="slot"><div class="last-mile-card"><div class="card-image-wrap"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3aeded498c5ec90f0b3ef_93c4249cbe0a499810ab5d0f8cb1f3023a375ade.png" loading="lazy" width="480" height="100" alt="" sizes="(max-width: 479px) 100vw, 480px" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3aeded498c5ec90f0b3ef_93c4249cbe0a499810ab5d0f8cb1f3023a375ade-p-500.png 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3aeded498c5ec90f0b3ef_93c4249cbe0a499810ab5d0f8cb1f3023a375ade-p-800.png 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3aeded498c5ec90f0b3ef_93c4249cbe0a499810ab5d0f8cb1f3023a375ade.png 920w" class="image-5"/></div><div class="card-content"><h3 class="heading">LED Tail Lights</h3><p class="paragraph">‍</p></div></div></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/plugins/Basic/assets/placeholder.60f9b1840c.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-181"/></div><div data-wf--slider_item--variant="base" class="slider_item swiper-slide"><div class="slot"><div class="last-mile-card"><div class="card-image-wrap"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3aeddf3d6889b41b8ef2f_935bcd6562197d425f7cf4b4bdcee68a093aaa88.png" loading="lazy" width="480" height="100" alt="" sizes="(max-width: 479px) 100vw, 480px" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3aeddf3d6889b41b8ef2f_935bcd6562197d425f7cf4b4bdcee68a093aaa88-p-500.png 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3aeddf3d6889b41b8ef2f_935bcd6562197d425f7cf4b4bdcee68a093aaa88-p-800.png 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3aeddf3d6889b41b8ef2f_935bcd6562197d425f7cf4b4bdcee68a093aaa88.png 920w" class="image-5"/></div><div class="card-content"><h3 class="heading">Wide-View Windshield</h3><p class="paragraph">AC Charging 0% - 80% ~ 6 Hrs DC charging 0-80% ~ 1 Hrs.</p></div></div></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/plugins/Basic/assets/placeholder.60f9b1840c.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-181"/></div></div></div><div class="slider_btn_element_left swiper-button-disabled is-prev"><div class="left-chevron-white w-icon-slider-left"></div></div><div class="slider_btn_element_right is-next"><div class="right-chevron-white w-icon-slider-right"></div></div><div class="slider_layout"></div></div></div><div data-w-tab="Tab 6" class="w-tab-pane"><div class="slider_component"><div class="slider_wrap swiper"><div class="slider_list swiper-wrapper"><div data-wf--slider_item--variant="base" class="slider_item swiper-slide"><div class="slot"><div class="last-mile-card"><div class="card-image-wrap"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3b4fc7506574e75e64408_lfpbattery.webp" loading="lazy" width="480" height="100" alt="" class="image-5"/></div><div class="card-content"><h3 class="heading">Advanced LFP Battery</h3><p class="paragraph">A liquid-cooled LFP battery improves safety, battery life, and consistent performance across different operating conditions.<br/></p></div></div></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/plugins/Basic/assets/placeholder.60f9b1840c.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-181"/></div><div data-wf--slider_item--variant="base" class="slider_item swiper-slide"><div class="slot"><div class="last-mile-card"><div class="card-image-wrap"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3b4fcf3d6889b41b98218_braking.webp" loading="lazy" width="480" height="100" alt="" class="image-5"/></div><div class="card-content"><h3 class="heading">Regenerative Braking</h3><p class="paragraph">Captures energy during deceleration and feeds it back to the battery, improving overall driving efficiency.<br/></p></div></div></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/plugins/Basic/assets/placeholder.60f9b1840c.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-181"/></div><div data-wf--slider_item--variant="base" class="slider_item swiper-slide"><div class="slot"><div class="last-mile-card"><div class="card-image-wrap"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3b4fb0c6d23e1840951e6_tech-Infotainment.webp" loading="lazy" width="480" height="100" alt="" class="image-5"/></div><div class="card-content"><h3 class="heading">Infotainment System</h3><p class="paragraph">Includes connected features such as navigation, reverse parking assistance, ADAS integration, and connected technologies.<br/></p></div></div></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/plugins/Basic/assets/placeholder.60f9b1840c.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-181"/></div><div data-wf--slider_item--variant="base" class="slider_item swiper-slide"><div class="slot"><div class="last-mile-card"><div class="card-image-wrap"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3b67e3ca8b37c1af89613_scv_tech_sdv.webp" loading="lazy" width="480" height="100" alt="" class="image-5"/></div><div class="card-content"><h3 class="heading">Software Defined Vehicle (SDV)</h3><p class="paragraph">Advanced digital architecture with features like:<br/>Over-the-air updates (OTA)<br/>Digital twin technology<br/>1M connected app for diagnostics and performance tracking.<br/></p></div></div></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/plugins/Basic/assets/placeholder.60f9b1840c.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-181"/></div></div></div><div class="slider_btn_element_left swiper-button-disabled is-prev"><div class="left-chevron-white w-icon-slider-left"></div></div><div class="slider_btn_element_right is-next"><div class="right-chevron-white w-icon-slider-right"></div></div><div class="slider_layout"></div></div></div><div data-w-tab="Tab 7" class="w-tab-pane"><div class="slider_component"><div class="slider_wrap swiper"><div class="slider_list swiper-wrapper"><div data-wf--slider_item--variant="base" class="slider_item swiper-slide"><div class="slot"><div class="last-mile-card"><div class="card-image-wrap"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3b4fb7506574e75e643f0_scv_safety_adas.webp" loading="lazy" width="480" height="100" alt="" sizes="(max-width: 479px) 100vw, 480px" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3b4fb7506574e75e643f0_scv_safety_adas-p-500.webp 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3b4fb7506574e75e643f0_scv_safety_adas-p-800.webp 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3b4fb7506574e75e643f0_scv_safety_adas.webp 920w" class="image-5"/></div><div class="card-content"><h3 class="heading">ADAS</h3><p class="paragraph">Advanced Driver Assistance Systems provide features like collision warnings, driver monitoring, and distraction alerts to enhance road safety.<br/></p></div></div></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/plugins/Basic/assets/placeholder.60f9b1840c.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-181"/></div><div data-wf--slider_item--variant="base" class="slider_item swiper-slide"><div class="slot"><div class="last-mile-card"><div class="card-image-wrap"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3b4fb3e26f0f69bc18d4d_safety-robustchassis.webp" loading="lazy" width="480" height="100" alt="" sizes="(max-width: 479px) 100vw, 480px" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3b4fb3e26f0f69bc18d4d_safety-robustchassis-p-500.webp 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3b4fb3e26f0f69bc18d4d_safety-robustchassis.webp 920w" class="image-5"/></div><div class="card-content"><h3 class="heading">Robust And Durable Chassis</h3><p class="paragraph">Strong chassis design improves structural strength, stability, and reliability.<br/></p></div></div></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/plugins/Basic/assets/placeholder.60f9b1840c.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-181"/></div><div data-wf--slider_item--variant="base" class="slider_item swiper-slide"><div class="slot"><div class="last-mile-card"><div class="card-image-wrap"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3b4fbbd3583189f19fa89_frontdisk.webp" loading="lazy" width="480" height="100" alt="" sizes="(max-width: 479px) 100vw, 480px" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3b4fbbd3583189f19fa89_frontdisk-p-500.webp 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3b4fbbd3583189f19fa89_frontdisk.webp 920w" class="image-5"/></div><div class="card-content"><h3 class="heading">Front Disc Brake</h3><p class="paragraph">Front disc brakes provide better stopping power and improved safety.<br/></p></div></div></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/plugins/Basic/assets/placeholder.60f9b1840c.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-181"/></div><div data-wf--slider_item--variant="base" class="slider_item swiper-slide"><div class="slot"><div class="last-mile-card"><div class="card-image-wrap"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3b4fb407e77f3006965ae_loadbalance.webp" loading="lazy" width="480" height="100" alt="" sizes="(max-width: 479px) 100vw, 480px" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3b4fb407e77f3006965ae_loadbalance-p-500.webp 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3b4fb407e77f3006965ae_loadbalance.webp 920w" class="image-5"/></div><div class="card-content"><h3 class="heading">Load Balance Rod</h3><p class="paragraph">Helps distribute weight evenly for improved vehicle balance and handling.<br/></p></div></div></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/plugins/Basic/assets/placeholder.60f9b1840c.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-181"/></div><div data-wf--slider_item--variant="base" class="slider_item swiper-slide"><div class="slot"><div class="last-mile-card"><div class="card-image-wrap"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3b4fb3ca8b37c1af86466_protectedpower.webp" loading="lazy" width="480" height="100" alt="" sizes="(max-width: 479px) 100vw, 480px" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3b4fb3ca8b37c1af86466_protectedpower-p-500.webp 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3b4fb3ca8b37c1af86466_protectedpower.webp 920w" class="image-5"/></div><div class="card-content"><h3 class="heading">IP67 Protected Power Electronics</h3><p class="paragraph">Ensures reliability and durability even in harsh weather or operating environments.<br/></p></div></div></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/plugins/Basic/assets/placeholder.60f9b1840c.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-181"/></div><div data-wf--slider_item--variant="base" class="slider_item swiper-slide"><div class="slot"><div class="last-mile-card"><div class="card-image-wrap"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3b4fb9049c18e8725cb49_hillholdassist.webp" loading="lazy" width="480" height="100" alt="" sizes="(max-width: 479px) 100vw, 480px" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3b4fb9049c18e8725cb49_hillholdassist-p-500.webp 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3b4fb9049c18e8725cb49_hillholdassist-p-800.webp 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3b4fb9049c18e8725cb49_hillholdassist.webp 920w" class="image-5"/></div><div class="card-content"><h3 class="heading">Hill-hold Assist</h3><p class="paragraph">Prevents rollback when starting on slopes, improving safety and driver confidence.<br/></p></div></div></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/plugins/Basic/assets/placeholder.60f9b1840c.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-181"/></div><div data-wf--slider_item--variant="base" class="slider_item swiper-slide"><div class="slot"><div class="last-mile-card"><div class="card-image-wrap"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3b4fc7506574e75e64408_lfpbattery.webp" loading="lazy" width="480" height="100" alt="" class="image-5"/></div><div class="card-content"><h3 class="heading">AIS-038 Phase 2 Compliance</h3><p class="paragraph">Complies with advanced vehicle safety standards.<br/></p></div></div></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/plugins/Basic/assets/placeholder.60f9b1840c.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-181"/></div><div data-wf--slider_item--variant="base" class="slider_item swiper-slide"><div class="slot"><div class="last-mile-card"><div class="card-image-wrap"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3b4fb4833131f0dbb88da_fronteaxle.webp" loading="lazy" width="480" height="100" alt="" sizes="(max-width: 479px) 100vw, 480px" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3b4fb4833131f0dbb88da_fronteaxle-p-500.webp 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3b4fb4833131f0dbb88da_fronteaxle.webp 920w" class="image-5"/></div><div class="card-content"><h3 class="heading">Front Axle With I-Beam</h3><p class="paragraph">‍</p></div></div></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/plugins/Basic/assets/placeholder.60f9b1840c.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-181"/></div><div data-wf--slider_item--variant="base" class="slider_item swiper-slide"><div class="slot"><div class="last-mile-card"><div class="card-image-wrap"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3b4fb3380bc9365816a7f_reareaxle.webp" loading="lazy" width="480" height="100" alt="" sizes="(max-width: 479px) 100vw, 480px" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3b4fb3380bc9365816a7f_reareaxle-p-500.webp 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3b4fb3380bc9365816a7f_reareaxle.webp 920w" class="image-5"/></div><div class="card-content"><h3 class="heading">Rear E-axle With Motor (Industry Best)</h3><p class="paragraph"></p></div></div></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/plugins/Basic/assets/placeholder.60f9b1840c.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-181"/></div></div></div><div class="slider_btn_element_left swiper-button-disabled is-prev"><div class="left-chevron-white w-icon-slider-left"></div></div><div class="slider_btn_element_right is-next"><div class="right-chevron-white w-icon-slider-right"></div></div><div class="slider_layout"></div></div></div><div data-w-tab="Tab 8" class="w-tab-pane"><div class="slider_component"><div class="slider_wrap swiper"><div class="slider_list swiper-wrapper"><div data-wf--slider_item--variant="base" class="slider_item swiper-slide"><div class="slot"><div class="last-mile-card"><div class="card-image-wrap"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69df464881cf6f47f5b74f3b_accabin%20(1).png" loading="lazy" width="480" height="100" alt="" class="image-5"/></div><div class="card-content"><h3 class="heading">AC Cabin</h3><p class="paragraph">An air-conditioned cabin improves comfort during long working hours and increases productivity.<br/></p></div></div></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/plugins/Basic/assets/placeholder.60f9b1840c.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-181"/></div><div data-wf--slider_item--variant="base" class="slider_item swiper-slide"><div class="slot"><div class="last-mile-card"><div class="card-image-wrap"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3aedee2206536c558598e_feb512ec7d8c39bf124b75e37ee88106d46efa29.jpg" loading="lazy" width="480" height="100" alt="" sizes="(max-width: 479px) 100vw, 480px" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3aedee2206536c558598e_feb512ec7d8c39bf124b75e37ee88106d46efa29-p-500.jpg 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3aedee2206536c558598e_feb512ec7d8c39bf124b75e37ee88106d46efa29-p-800.jpg 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3aedee2206536c558598e_feb512ec7d8c39bf124b75e37ee88106d46efa29-p-1080.jpg 1080w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3aedee2206536c558598e_feb512ec7d8c39bf124b75e37ee88106d46efa29-p-1600.jpg 1600w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3aedee2206536c558598e_feb512ec7d8c39bf124b75e37ee88106d46efa29.jpg 1632w" class="image-5"/></div><div class="card-content"><h3 class="heading">Advanced 2-Stage Parabolic Suspension</h3><p class="paragraph">Designed for smoother rides and better load stability.<br/></p></div></div></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/plugins/Basic/assets/placeholder.60f9b1840c.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-181"/></div><div data-wf--slider_item--variant="base" class="slider_item swiper-slide"><div class="slot"><div class="last-mile-card"><div class="card-image-wrap"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3aede5f06caa01a1c3cfd_ff92460656eaf867be1b1c255e5ae54101805a4c.png" loading="lazy" width="480" height="100" alt="" class="image-5"/></div><div class="card-content"><h3 class="heading">Reclining Adjustable Driver Seat</h3><p class="paragraph">Driver seat with headrest and reclining adjustment for better ergonomics and reduced fatigue.<br/></p></div></div></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/plugins/Basic/assets/placeholder.60f9b1840c.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-181"/></div><div data-wf--slider_item--variant="base" class="slider_item swiper-slide"><div class="slot"><div class="last-mile-card"><div class="card-image-wrap"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69da2a3e67dfb880dfa4fb5f_comfort-drivemodes.webp" loading="lazy" width="480" height="100" alt="" sizes="(max-width: 479px) 100vw, 480px" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69da2a3e67dfb880dfa4fb5f_comfort-drivemodes-p-500.webp 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69da2a3e67dfb880dfa4fb5f_comfort-drivemodes-p-800.webp 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69da2a3e67dfb880dfa4fb5f_comfort-drivemodes.webp 920w" class="image-5"/></div><div class="card-content"><h3 class="heading">Smart Drive Mode Switch</h3><p class="paragraph">Drivers can switch between City mode and Power mode to match driving conditions.<br/></p></div></div></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/plugins/Basic/assets/placeholder.60f9b1840c.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-181"/></div><div data-wf--slider_item--variant="base" class="slider_item swiper-slide"><div class="slot"><div class="last-mile-card"><div class="card-image-wrap"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69da2a3e07e169d0e84ba385_groundclearance.webp" loading="lazy" width="480" height="100" alt="" sizes="(max-width: 479px) 100vw, 480px" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69da2a3e07e169d0e84ba385_groundclearance-p-500.webp 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69da2a3e07e169d0e84ba385_groundclearance.webp 920w" class="image-5"/></div><div class="card-content"><h3 class="heading">Best-in-Class Ground Clearance</h3><p class="paragraph">Around 197 mm ground clearance, allowing the vehicle to handle rough or uneven roads easily.<br/></p></div></div></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/plugins/Basic/assets/placeholder.60f9b1840c.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-181"/></div></div></div><div class="slider_btn_element_left swiper-button-disabled is-prev"><div class="left-chevron-white w-icon-slider-left"></div></div><div class="slider_btn_element_right is-next"><div class="right-chevron-white w-icon-slider-right"></div></div><div class="slider_layout"></div></div></div><div data-w-tab="Tab 9" class="w-tab-pane"><div class="slider_component"><div class="slider_wrap swiper"><div class="slider_list swiper-wrapper"><div data-wf--slider_item--variant="base" class="slider_item swiper-slide"><div class="slot"><div class="last-mile-card"><div class="card-image-wrap"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69da2ac556f34557d9171dda_walkthroughcabin.webp" loading="lazy" width="480" height="100" alt="" sizes="(max-width: 479px) 100vw, 480px" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69da2ac556f34557d9171dda_walkthroughcabin-p-500.webp 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69da2ac556f34557d9171dda_walkthroughcabin.webp 920w" class="image-5"/></div><div class="card-content"><h3 class="heading">Spacious Walkthrough Cabin</h3><p class="paragraph">Ergonomic cabin layout improves movement and comfort for the driver.</p></div></div></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/plugins/Basic/assets/placeholder.60f9b1840c.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-181"/></div><div data-wf--slider_item--variant="base" class="slider_item swiper-slide"><div class="slot"><div class="last-mile-card"><div class="card-image-wrap"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69da2ac567dfb880dfa5023a_steering.webp" loading="lazy" width="480" height="100" alt="" sizes="(max-width: 479px) 100vw, 480px" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69da2ac567dfb880dfa5023a_steering-p-500.webp 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69da2ac567dfb880dfa5023a_steering.webp 920w" class="image-5"/></div><div class="card-content"><h3 class="heading">Electric Power Steering</h3><p class="paragraph">Electric power steering ensures smoother control and reduces driver effort during long drives.<br/></p></div></div></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/plugins/Basic/assets/placeholder.60f9b1840c.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-181"/></div><div data-wf--slider_item--variant="base" class="slider_item swiper-slide"><div class="slot"><div class="last-mile-card"><div class="card-image-wrap"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69da2ac55931b223dc4fd9e8_chargingports.webp" loading="lazy" width="480" height="100" alt="" sizes="(max-width: 479px) 100vw, 480px" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69da2ac55931b223dc4fd9e8_chargingports-p-500.webp 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69da2ac55931b223dc4fd9e8_chargingports-p-800.webp 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69da2ac55931b223dc4fd9e8_chargingports.webp 920w" class="image-5"/></div><div class="card-content"><h3 class="heading">USB Charging Ports </h3><p class="paragraph">Conveniently placed USB ports keep your devices powered, wherever the day takes you.</p></div></div></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/plugins/Basic/assets/placeholder.60f9b1840c.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-181"/></div><div data-wf--slider_item--variant="base" class="slider_item swiper-slide"><div class="slot"><div class="last-mile-card"><div class="card-image-wrap"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69da2ac506cf5349b59dfc52_parkingcamera.webp" loading="lazy" width="480" height="100" alt="" sizes="(max-width: 479px) 100vw, 480px" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69da2ac506cf5349b59dfc52_parkingcamera-p-500.webp 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69da2ac506cf5349b59dfc52_parkingcamera.webp 920w" class="image-5"/></div><div class="card-content"><h3 class="heading">Reverse Parking Camera</h3><p class="paragraph">A clear rear view helps you park with confidence and avoid obstacles with ease.</p></div></div></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/plugins/Basic/assets/placeholder.60f9b1840c.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-181"/></div><div data-wf--slider_item--variant="base" class="slider_item swiper-slide"><div class="slot"><div class="last-mile-card"><div class="card-image-wrap"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69da2ac56193f610ba14bbd3_foglamps.webp" loading="lazy" width="480" height="100" alt="" sizes="(max-width: 479px) 100vw, 480px" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69da2ac56193f610ba14bbd3_foglamps-p-500.webp 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69da2ac56193f610ba14bbd3_foglamps-p-800.webp 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69da2ac56193f610ba14bbd3_foglamps.webp 920w" class="image-5"/></div><div class="card-content"><h3 class="heading">Fog Lamps</h3><p class="paragraph">Powerful fog lamps enhance visibility, keeping you safe in low-light and foggy conditions.</p></div></div></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/plugins/Basic/assets/placeholder.60f9b1840c.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-181"/></div></div></div><div class="slider_btn_element_left swiper-button-disabled is-prev"><div class="left-chevron-white w-icon-slider-left"></div></div><div class="slider_btn_element_right is-next"><div class="right-chevron-white w-icon-slider-right"></div></div><div class="slider_layout"></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="base-container-padding-flex-gap old"><div data-wf--header--variant="base" class="carousel-header"><h2 class="heading-2">The EViator Ecosystem</h2></div><div data-current="Tab 8" data-easing="ease" data-duration-in="300" data-duration-out="100" class="tabs-2 only-slider-2 w-tabs"><div class="tabs-menu-3 only-slider-3 w-tab-menu"><a data-w-tab="Tab 8" class="tab-link-tab-1-3 only-slider-13 w-inline-block w-tab-link w--current"><div class="text-block-62 only-slider-14">Service</div></a><a data-w-tab="Tab 9" class="tab-link-tab-1-3 only-slider-13 w-inline-block w-tab-link"><div class="text-block-62 only-slider-14">Charging</div></a></div><div class="tabs-content only-slider-15 w-tab-content"><div data-w-tab="Tab 8" class="w-tab-pane w--tab-active"><div class="slider_component"><div class="slider_wrap swiper"><div class="slider_list swiper-wrapper"><div data-wf--slider_item--variant="base" class="slider_item swiper-slide"><div class="slot"><div class="last-mile-card"><div class="card-image-wrap"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69c107f88118a06a4170530d_Montra%20EViator-22.jpg" loading="lazy" width="480" height="100" alt="" sizes="(max-width: 479px) 100vw, 480px" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69c107f88118a06a4170530d_Montra%20EViator-22-p-500.jpg 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69c107f88118a06a4170530d_Montra%20EViator-22.jpg 628w" class="image-5"/></div><div class="card-content"><h3 class="heading">Warranty</h3><p class="paragraph">Standard vehicle warranty: 5 years / 1.75 lakh km<br/>Standard battery warranty: 5 years / 1.75 lakh km</p></div></div></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/plugins/Basic/assets/placeholder.60f9b1840c.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-181"/></div><div data-wf--slider_item--variant="base" class="slider_item swiper-slide"><div class="slot"><div class="last-mile-card"><div class="card-image-wrap"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69c107fbc458e48972829baf_Montra%20EViator-23.jpg" loading="lazy" width="480" height="100" alt="" sizes="(max-width: 479px) 100vw, 480px" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69c107fbc458e48972829baf_Montra%20EViator-23-p-500.jpg 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69c107fbc458e48972829baf_Montra%20EViator-23.jpg 628w" class="image-5"/></div><div class="card-content"><h3 class="heading">Extended Warranty</h3><p class="paragraph">Extended coverage available up to 7 years / 2.5 lakh km</p></div></div></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/plugins/Basic/assets/placeholder.60f9b1840c.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-181"/></div><div data-wf--slider_item--variant="base" class="slider_item swiper-slide"><div class="slot"><div class="last-mile-card"><div class="card-image-wrap"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3b871bd3583189f1a56b0_fe74904ed558f5aba7f4c7aeb9efe795f743ab82.png" loading="lazy" width="480" height="100" alt="" class="image-5"/></div><div class="card-content"><h3 class="heading">Annual Maintenance Packages</h3><p class="paragraph">Maintenance plans available to keep vehicles running efficiently.<br/></p></div></div></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/plugins/Basic/assets/placeholder.60f9b1840c.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-181"/></div><div data-wf--slider_item--variant="base" class="slider_item swiper-slide"><div class="slot"><div class="last-mile-card"><div class="card-image-wrap"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3b872e198a5218a8a37c5_2fb07f2611fa487e02161ae30d4778d471949e13.png" loading="lazy" width="480" height="100" alt="" class="image-5"/></div><div class="card-content"><h3 class="heading">24/7 Uptime Center</h3><p class="paragraph">Real-time monitoring ensures <strong>around 95% vehicle uptime</strong> with proactive support and service.<br/></p></div></div></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/plugins/Basic/assets/placeholder.60f9b1840c.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-181"/></div><div data-wf--slider_item--variant="base" class="slider_item swiper-slide"><div class="slot"><div class="last-mile-card"><div class="card-image-wrap"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69b3b872e42317f4ae02871a_3a5a34947a5a7ef87ffffb71c106d2082b9c4448.png" loading="lazy" width="480" height="100" alt="" class="image-5"/></div><div class="card-content"><h3 class="heading">Proactive Vehicle Diagnostics</h3><p class="paragraph">Predictive diagnostics monitor vehicle health and help prevent unexpected breakdowns.</p></div></div></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/plugins/Basic/assets/placeholder.60f9b1840c.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-181"/></div><div data-wf--slider_item--variant="base" class="slider_item swiper-slide"><div class="slot"><div class="last-mile-card"><div class="card-image-wrap"><img src="http