</style></div></a></div><div role="listitem" class="team-slider_cms_item swiper-slide w-dyn-item"><a href="https://www.autocarpro.in/news/montra-electric-partners-with-green-drive-mobility-to-deploy-50-electric-commercial-vehicles-127448" class="div-block-167 w-inline-block"><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69a5760675b73df3a7b833b3/69da32042f0a489d54b460e4_69d36582799f2d2eafdb8845_b556f68e-9da9-48b2-9cec-21ae8435c32f_20250710.avif" alt="" class="image-102"/><div class="div-block-166"><div class="text-block-100">July 10, 2025</div><div class="text-block-99 blog-text-class">Montra Electric Partners with Green Drive Mobility to Deploy 50 Electric Commercial Vehicles</div><div class="div-block-168"><div class="text-block-34">Autocar Professional</div></div></div><div class="w-embed"><style>
.blog-text-class {
  overflow: hidden;
  text-overflow: ellipsis;
  display: -webkit-box;
  -webkit-line-clamp: 2; /* number of lines to show */
  line-clamp: 2;
  -webkit-box-orient: vertical;
}
</style></div></a></div></div></div><div class="team-slider_btn_element_left swiper-button-disabled is-prev"><div class="left-chevron-white w-icon-slider-left"></div></div><div class="team-slider_btn_element_right is-next"><div class="right-chevron-white w-icon-slider-right"></div></div><div class="team-slider_layout"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="base-container-padding-flex-gap"><div data-wf--header--variant="base" class="carousel-header"><h2 class="heading-2">Montra Electric Eviator Electric Mini Truck FAQs<br/></h2></div><div><div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" class="dropdown w-dropdown"><div class="dropdown-toggle w-dropdown-toggle"><div class="w-icon-dropdown-toggle"></div><div class="text-block-127">What is the real-world range and payload efficiency of Montra Electric Eviator electric mini truck for goods transport?</div></div><nav class="dropdown-list w-dropdown-list"><div class="text-block-128">The Montra Electric Eviator electric delivery mini truck delivers 170+ km real world range with a full 1,707kg payload capacity for intercity goods transport. This electric small commercial vehicle maintains 80kmph highway speeds even when fully loaded, unlike other electric vehicles that lose performance with heavy cargo. The 40 kWh battery ensures consistent long-distance hauling capability for electric mini truck operations.</div></nav></div><div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" class="dropdown w-dropdown"><div class="dropdown-toggle w-dropdown-toggle"><div class="w-icon-dropdown-toggle"></div><div class="text-block-127">What charging infrastructure and time planning is needed for Montra Electric Eviator electric small commercial vehicle operations?</div></div><nav class="dropdown-list w-dropdown-list"><div class="text-block-128">The Montra Electric Eviator electric mini truck supports both AC charging for overnight depot charging and DC fast charging for rapid turnaround during operations. On a 7.4 kW AC charger it takes 6 hr 43 min to do 20% to 100%. Using a 30 kW DC fast charger, it reaches 100% from 20% in just 1 hr 29 min. Heavy-duty transport requires dedicated 3-phase charging infrastructure at logistics hubs, and the truck&#x27;s dual charging capability enables 24/7 operational scheduling without range anxiety.</div></nav></div><div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" class="dropdown w-dropdown"><div class="dropdown-toggle w-dropdown-toggle"><div class="w-icon-dropdown-toggle"></div><div class="text-block-127">What service and maintenance schedule does Montra Electric Eviator electric delivery mini truck require for heavy-duty use?</div></div><nav class="dropdown-list w-dropdown-list"><div class="text-block-128">The Montra Electric Eviator electric small commercial vehicle will need comprehensive servicing as per your owners manual. Servicing including brake system inspection, suspension checks, and battery diagnostics. Heavy-duty electric mini truck operations benefit from predictive maintenance through AI-enabled diagnostics and 24/7 telematics monitoring. Maintenance costs are lower than equivalent diesel trucks.</div></nav></div><div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" class="dropdown w-dropdown"><div class="dropdown-toggle w-dropdown-toggle"><div class="w-icon-dropdown-toggle"></div><div class="text-block-127">What commercial financing options are available for Montra Electric Eviator electric mini truck purchase?</div></div><nav class="dropdown-list w-dropdown-list"><div class="text-block-128">The Montra Electric Eviator electric delivery mini truck qualifies for heavy commercial vehicle financing, equipment loans, and specialized EV fleet funding. Financial institutions offer attractive rates for electric small commercial vehicle purchases under priority sector lending. Government incentives include accelerated depreciation, input tax credit, and state-specific electric mini truck subsidies. Extended warranty packages (7 years/2.75 lakh km) are available for fleet operators.</div></nav></div><div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" class="dropdown w-dropdown"><div class="dropdown-toggle w-dropdown-toggle"><div class="w-icon-dropdown-toggle"></div><div class="text-block-127">What is the goods carrying capacity and cabin configuration of Montra Electric Eviator electric small commercial vehicle?</div></div><nav class="dropdown-list w-dropdown-list"><div class="text-block-128">The Montra Electric Eviator electric mini truck offers 1,707kg payload with driver+2 seating in a day cabin configuration. This electric delivery mini truck features a deck body design suitable for diverse cargo types, tiltable cabin for maintenance access, and 3140mm length for optimal loading. The electric small commercial vehicle includes power steering, hill hold assist, and digital cluster for driver convenience during long hauls.</div></nav></div><div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" class="dropdown w-dropdown"><div class="dropdown-toggle w-dropdown-toggle"><div class="w-icon-dropdown-toggle"></div><div class="text-block-127">How does Montra Electric Eviator electric delivery mini truck compare to diesel mini trucks in operational efficiency?</div></div><nav class="dropdown-list w-dropdown-list"><div class="text-block-128">The Montra Electric Eviator electric small commercial vehicle eliminates ₹1,200-1,500 daily diesel costs for equivalent transport operations. With electricity costing ₹400 for full charge, daily fuel savings exceed ₹800-1,000 per vehicle. This electric mini truck provides 300Nm torque, silent operation, zero emission compliance, and 95% uptime with predictive maintenance - significantly outperforming diesel alternatives in total cost of ownership.</div></nav></div></div></div><div data-wf--side-menu-grid--variant="hide-view-brochure" class="grid-6 w-variant-8b046784-2286-f1de-a1a3-d2bff07b69f4"><div data-w-id="4c2609b0-f4d0-ae43-2625-4121e08398c0" class="grid-div-1"><div class="row1"><div class="text-block-54">Find Dealer</div></div><a href="/findadealer" class="div-block-96 w-inline-block"><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69f25eb02bd654493c7733d2_Pin_light.svg" alt=""/></a></div><div data-w-id="4c2609b0-f4d0-ae43-2625-4121e08398c6" class="grid-div-2"><div class="row2"><div class="text-block-54">Book A Test Drive</div></div><a href="/book-test-drive" class="div-block-96 w-inline-block"><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69f25eb07bf8c0598bed047d_Date_range_duotone_line.svg" alt=""/></a></div><div data-w-id="4c2609b0-f4d0-ae43-2625-4121e08398cc" class="grid-div-3 w-variant-8b046784-2286-f1de-a1a3-d2bff07b69f4"><div class="row3"><div class="text-block-54">View Brochure</div></div><div class="div-block-96"><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69f25eb0d6f2408625d4969d_File_dock_light.svg" alt=""/></div></div><div data-brochure-pdf="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/6a420aca1c64100dbb2134a1_EVIATOR%20Range%20Brochure.pdf" data-w-id="3dce5d7d-e7bb-21ab-ebf9-c9d6b85d97ee" class="grid-div-4"><div class="row4 w-variant-8b046784-2286-f1de-a1a3-d2bff07b69f4"><div class="text-block-54">Download Brochure</div></div><div class="div-block-96"><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69f25e380c30f0b3538cbdd0_svgviewer-output.svg" alt=""/></div></div><div data-w-id="4c2609b0-f4d0-ae43-2625-4121e08398d2" class="grid-div-5"><div class="row5"><div class="text-block-54">WhatsApp Chat</div></div><a href="https://api.whatsapp.com/send/?phone=9240298953&amp;text=Hi%2C+I%27m+interested+in+more+information+about+Montra+Electric+Commercial+Vehicles.&amp;type=phone_number&amp;app_absent=0" target="_blank" class="div-block-96 w-inline-block"><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/69f25eb0b04a0c7be3590deb_hugeicons_whatsapp.svg" alt="" class="image-28"/></a></div><div id="brochure-modal-wrap" class="brochure-modal-wrap w-variant-8b046784-2286-f1de-a1a3-d2bff07b69f4 w-node-ba768e2c-4ca3-a21e-b5e0-e52aadd20261-e08398bf"><div class="brochure-modal"><div class="div-block-298"><div class="modal-title">Fill the Form to download the Brochure</div><div data-w-id="ba768e2c-4ca3-a21e-b5e0-e52aadd20266"><div id="close-modal-x" class="text-block-121">×</div></div></div><div class="brochure-form-block w-form"><form id="brochure-form" name="email-form" data-name="Email Form" method="post" class="brochure-form" data-wf-page-id="69b25ec1bedf8471e194a5c4" data-wf-element-id="ba768e2c-4ca3-a21e-b5e0-e52aadd2026a" data-turnstile-sitekey="0x4AAAAAAAQTptj2So4dx43e"><div id="w-node-ba768e2c-4ca3-a21e-b5e0-e52aadd2026b-e08398bf" class="div-block-297"><label for="Set-your-Country" class="field-label">Name*</label><input class="text-field-3 w-input" autofocus="true" maxlength="256" name="name" data-name="name" placeholder="Full Name" type="text" id="name" required=""/></div><div id="w-node-ba768e2c-4ca3-a21e-b5e0-e52aadd2026f-e08398bf" class="div-block-297"><label for="Set-your-Country" class="field-label">Mobile Number*</label><input class="text-field-3 w-input" maxlength="256" name="mobile" data-name="mobile" placeholder="Mobile Number" type="tel" id="mobile" required=""/></div><div id="w-node-ba768e2c-4ca3-a21e-b5e0-e52aadd20273-e08398bf" class="div-block-297"><label for="Set-your-Country" class="field-label">E-Mail*</label><input class="text-field-3 w-input" maxlength="256" name="email" data-name="email" placeholder="E-Mail" type="email" id="email" required=""/></div><div class="div-block-297"><label for="Set-your-Country" class="field-label">City*</label><input class="text-field-3 w-input" maxlength="256" name="city" data-name="city" placeholder="City" type="text" id="city" required=""/></div><div class="div-block-297"><label for="Set-your-Country" class="field-label">Pincode*</label><input class="text-field-3 w-input" maxlength="256" name="pincode" data-name="pincode" placeholder="Pincode" type="text" id="pincode" required=""/></div><div id="w-node-ba768e2c-4ca3-a21e-b5e0-e52aadd2027f-e08398bf">By Clicking Submit, you acknowledge that you have read our <a href="https://www.montraelectric.com/privacy" target="_blank">Privacy Policy</a></div><label id="w-node-ba768e2c-4ca3-a21e-b5e0-e52aadd20283-e08398bf" class="w-checkbox"><input type="checkbox" name="Checkbox" id="Checkbox" data-name="Checkbox" required="" class="w-checkbox-input"/><span class="w-form-label" for="Checkbox">I hereby authorize to send notifications on SMS/ Messages/ Promotions/ Informational Messages.</span></label><div id="w-node-ba768e2c-4ca3-a21e-b5e0-e52aadd20287-e08398bf" class="modal-button-row"><a id="close-modal" href="#" class="button-38 w-button">Cancel</a><input type="submit" data-wait="Please wait..." class="submit-button-3 w-button" value="Submit &amp; Download"/></div></form><div class="w-form-done"><div>Thank you! Your submission has been received!</div></div><div class="w-form-fail"><div>Oops! Something went wrong while submitting the form.</div></div></div></div><div class="code-embed-14 w-embed w-script"><script>
  document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function () {
    const modal = document.getElementById('brochure-modal-wrap');
    const form = document.getElementById('brochure-form');
    const PDF_URL = document.querySelector('[data-brochure-pdf]').dataset.brochurePdf;

    // FORM SUBMIT
    if (form) {
      form.addEventListener('submit', async function (e) {
        e.preventDefault();

        console.log('Submit triggered ✅');

        const data = {
          name: document.getElementById('name')?.value,
          mobile: '+91' + document.getElementById('mobile')?.value,
          email: document.getElementById('email')?.value,
          city: document.getElementById('city')?.value,
          pincode: document.getElementById('pincode')?.value,
        };

        console.log('Sending:', data);

        try {
          const response = await fetch('https://www.montraelectric.com/mdataapi/post/download-brouchure', {
            method: 'POST',
            headers: {
              'Content-Type': 'application/json',
            },
            body: JSON.stringify(data),
          });

          console.log('Response:', response);

          if (response.ok) {
            modal.style.display = 'none';

            const pdfresponse = await fetch(PDF_URL);
            const blob = await pdfresponse.blob();

            const blobUrl = window.URL.createObjectURL(blob);

            const a = document.createElement('a');
            a.href = blobUrl;
            a.download = 'file.pdf';
            document.body.appendChild(a);
            a.click();
            a.remove();

            window.URL.revokeObjectURL(blobUrl);
          } else {
            alert('Submission failed');
          }
        } catch (error) {
          console.error('Error:', error);
          alert('Error submitting form');
        }
      });
    }
  });
</script></div></div><div data-w-id="3f6b1ba3-59b1-a9c6-2c99-8c00db857ab6" class="pdf-overlay"><div class="code-embed-15 w-embed w-iframe"><iframe allowfullscreen allow="clipboard-write" scrolling="no" className="fp-iframe" src="https://heyzine.com/flip-book/c481a39dac.html" style="border: 1px solid lightgray; width: 100%; height: 550px;"></iframe></div></div></div><section class="footer-main-copy-copy"><div class="base-container-padding-flex-gap-c"><div class="footer-grid-copy-copy"><div id="w-node-ad4fc399-69b2-4256-755a-c0ca2328856c-23288569" class="div-block-387"><div class="div-block-388"><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6938169ca88035d1476d6905/695c0ee85b40e52e787d7426_left_logo%201.svg" alt="" class="image-277"/></div><div class="div-block-380 div-block-388"><div class="contact-copy"><div data-figma-id="68:2127" class="frame-18-copy"><div data-figma-id="68:2129" class="frame-17-copy"><p data-figma-id="68:2130" class="_2025-montra-electric-all-rights-reserved">© 2026 Montra Electric . All rights reserved</p><a data-figma-id="68:2131" href="/privacy-policy-powerdock" class="privacy-policy">Privacy Policy - Power Dock</a><a data-figma-id="68:2131" href="/privacy" class="privacy-policy">Privacy Policy</a></div></div></div></div></div><div id="w-node-ad4fc399-69b2-4256-755a-c0ca23288579-23288569" class="div-block-383"><div class="text-block-155-copy">Our Product</div><a href="/lastmile/superauto" class="link-block-35 w-inline-block"><div class="text-block-154">Super Auto</div></a><a href="/lastmile/supercargo" class="link-block-36 w-inline-block"><div class="text-block-154">Super Cargo</div></a><a href="/e-scv/eviator" aria-current="page" class="link-block-37 w-inline-block w--current"><div class="text-block-154">EVIATOR</div></a><a href="/e-mhcv/rhino" class="link-block-38 w-inline-block"><div class="text-block-154">Rhino</div></a><a href="/etractor/e-27" class="link-block-39 w-inline-block"><div class="text-block-154">Tractor</div></a>